CO.6a marker map — Mag GDS SHA 969dff4700bc53222a869a129f7d76a89baae758be8bd68b427f83df6da23fba

Rule: CO.6a Metal1 (<0.34 µm) EOL overlap of contact = 0.06 µm.
Each marker is a 5 nm X-offset between contact left edge and Metal1 EOL
on a 0.06 µm vertical contact edge.

PDK GDS of gf180mcu_fd_sc_mcu9t5v0__aoi221_2 Metal1/contact polygons are
byte-identical to the Mag-streamed cell. Probe DRC of PDK cells only:

  aoi221_2 R0  : CO.6a = 0
  aoi221_2 MX  : CO.6a = 1 (same 5 nm class)
  aoi221_1 R0  : CO.6a = 0
  aoi221_1 MX  : CO.6a = 0

 Mag stream-out does not introduce the 5 nm. It is the PDK MX aoi221_2
 cell, the same class previously closed by aoi221_2 MX -> aoi221_1.

ODB aoi221_2: 12 total (9 MX + 3 R0). All 9 MX are the 9 KLayout markers.
3 R0 aoi221_2 are clean and left unchanged.

